# 🏗️ MASTER TECHNICAL PROMPT — SHOPIFY PAGE BUILDER APP
### (PageFly / GemPages / EComposer Clone — Full Technical Spec)

---

## 🎯 PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a **production-ready Shopify Embedded App** — a drag-and-drop landing page builder that allows Shopify merchants to visually create, customize, and publish high-converting pages (landing pages, product pages, collection pages, homepages, blog pages, 404 pages, coming soon pages) — without writing any code.

The app must work exactly like **PageFly**, **GemPages**, and **EComposer**, with a full visual editor embedded inside the Shopify admin, and a **storefront renderer** that displays those pages on the live store at blazing speed.

