## ⚙️ FULL TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE

### Architecture Pattern: 3-Layer System

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  LAYER 1: ADMIN EDITOR (Embedded Shopify App)            │
│  React + Shopify App Bridge + Polaris + DnD             │
│  Runs inside Shopify Admin iframe                        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  LAYER 2: BACKEND API (Node.js / Remix)                  │
│  Handles OAuth, page storage, Shopify GraphQL calls     │
│  Stores page JSON schemas in DB, writes Liquid to store  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  LAYER 3: STOREFRONT RENDERER                            │
│  Theme App Extension OR ScriptTag API                   │
│  Reads page JSON → renders HTML on storefront           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

