## 🛠️ FULL TECH STACK

### Backend
- **Runtime**: Node.js 20+ / Remix v2 (Shopify's official recommended framework)
- **Framework**: `@shopify/shopify-app-remix` (handles OAuth, webhooks, session management)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL via Prisma ORM (stores page schemas, templates, user plans)
- **Session Storage**: Prisma Session Storage (SQLite for dev, Postgres for prod)
- **File Hosting**: AWS S3 / Cloudflare R2 (stores uploaded images, custom fonts)
- **CDN**: Cloudflare CDN (serves storefront renderer JS bundle)
- **Queue**: Bull + Redis (for async publish jobs, image optimization)
- **Cache**: Redis (page JSON cache, Shopify API rate limit buffer)

### Frontend (Admin Editor)
- **Framework**: React 18 + TypeScript
- **Shopify UI**: `@shopify/polaris` (Shopify's design system)
- **App Bridge**: `@shopify/app-bridge` CDN version (embedded app auth, Resource Picker)
- **Drag & Drop**: `@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable` (best performance, accessible)
- **State Management**: Zustand (editor state) + React Query (server state)
- **Canvas/Preview**: `iframe` with postMessage communication
- **Rich Text**: TipTap editor (for text blocks)
- **Color Picker**: `react-colorful`
- **Icons**: Lucide React + custom SVG icon set
- **Animations**: Framer Motion (editor micro-interactions)

### Storefront Renderer
- **Method**: Shopify **Theme App Extension** (primary, OS 2.0 compatible)
- **Fallback**: ScriptTag API + `window.__PAGEBUILDER__` hydration
- **Render Strategy**: Server-side Liquid + client-side JS hydration for interactive blocks
- **Bundle Size Target**: < 30kb gzipped for storefront JS
- **Performance**: Vanilla JS only on storefront (NO React/Vue — too heavy)

