## 🔌 SHOPIFY INTEGRATION LAYER

### 1. App Installation (OAuth Flow)

```
Merchant installs app →
  Shopify redirects to /auth?shop=xyz.myshopify.com →
  App redirects to Shopify OAuth page →
  Merchant approves scopes →
  Shopify redirects to /auth/callback?code=xxx →
  App exchanges code for access_token →
  App stores access_token in DB →
  App installs ScriptTag + Theme App Extension →
  Merchant redirected to App inside Admin
```

**Required OAuth Scopes:**
```
read_products, write_products
read_content, write_content        (for saving pages)
read_themes, write_themes          (for theme app extensions)
read_script_tags, write_script_tags
read_files, write_files
read_analytics
read_customers
```

### 2. How Pages Are Saved to Shopify

There are **two rendering strategies** — implement BOTH with automatic selection:

#### Strategy A: Theme App Extension (PREFERRED — OS 2.0)
1. App creates a Shopify `Page` resource via Admin API with a custom template name
2. A `page.builder.liquid` template is injected into the theme via Theme API
3. This template reads from `page.metafields.pagebuilder.schema` 
4. A Liquid + JS renderer in the theme app extension reads the JSON and outputs HTML
5. Result: **zero ScriptTag overhead**, pages are fully server-rendered

```liquid
{%- comment -%} templates/page.builder.liquid {%- endcomment -%}
{% assign pb_schema = page.metafields.pagebuilder.schema.value %}
{% if pb_schema %}
  <div id="pb-page-root" data-page-id="{{ page.id }}">
    {% render 'pb-renderer', schema: pb_schema %}
  </div>
{% endif %}
```

#### Strategy B: ScriptTag (Fallback for older themes)
1. App injects a `<script src="https://cdn.yourdomain.com/renderer.js">` via ScriptTag API
2. The renderer JS fetches page schema from app API using shop domain
3. Hydrates and renders into `<div id="pb-app-root">` which is injected via Liquid snippet

```javascript
// renderer.js (< 30kb gzipped)
(function() {
  const ROOT = document.getElementById('pb-app-root');
  if (!ROOT) return;
  const pageId = ROOT.dataset.pageId;
  
  fetch(`https://api.yourdomain.com/render/${pageId}?shop=${Shopify.shop}`)
    .then(r => r.json())
    .then(({ html, css }) => {
      const style = document.createElement('style');
      style.textContent = css;
      document.head.appendChild(style);
      ROOT.innerHTML = html;
      initInteractiveBlocks(); // countdown timers, carousels, etc.
    });
})();
```

