## 🔒 SECURITY

- **OAuth token storage**: Encrypted at rest in DB, never exposed to frontend
- **Session validation**: Every API request validates Shopify session token (JWT)
- **HMAC verification**: All webhook payloads verified with `SHOPIFY_API_SECRET`
- **Rate limiting**: Redis-based rate limiter on all API routes (100 req/min per shop)
- **Content Security Policy**: Strict CSP headers on embedded app
- **ScriptTag integrity**: SRI hashes on CDN-hosted renderer files
- **XSS prevention**: All user HTML in `raw_html` blocks sandboxed in an `<iframe srcdoc>`
- **Input sanitization**: DOMPurify on any HTML output from user content

