## 🚀 PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS

| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| Lighthouse Mobile Score | > 90 |
| LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) | < 2.5s |
| CLS | < 0.1 |
| Storefront JS Bundle | < 30kb gzip |
| Editor Load Time | < 3s |
| Page Schema Save | < 500ms |
| Template Load | < 200ms |

**Optimizations:**
- Lazy load all images with IntersectionObserver
- CSS-in-JSON approach: generate minimal critical CSS per page
- Font subsetting for custom fonts
- Image CDN with auto WebP/AVIF conversion
- Schema stored in Redis with 5-min TTL
- Edge caching of rendered HTML (Cloudflare Workers optional)

